    {
      "id": "74bd9afa-8b50-412e-8b36-a0b3567a3278",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e repare onde a cor aparece na expressão.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "120bd6cc-9502-4e6b-9d66-8696afde06cc",
          "textContent": "<p>Em espanhol, a cor costuma vir depois do objeto.</p><p><strong>el móvil negro</strong></p><p>Primeiro você reconhece o objeto. Depois, a informação da cor.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "05731a50-6d35-417d-88b5-cdcd478ee10c",
      "title": "Olhe a imagem, escute o áudio e observe a nova combinação em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "c1c1058f-b3f5-4ed6-b324-88f3d2699d38",
          "textContent": "<p>Olhe, escute e leia.</p><p><strong>la cartera roja</strong></p><p>Em português: a carteira vermelha.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c7af0c5effb94641b7307551f79e000c_b04-la-cartera-roja.png?Expires=1794099469&Signature=xgXqvpd4hE3ifUnzJuf4mnkwLozhAP8Md20B-2dYim0aQ5AzjApil8A99SRcMOWONCKbHRLbRyoiPuOgOa41WXrCYp7V~iF5OLpfh7lc-g1HS0Sw6eFZXCqoDm2MZ~6VQRUBMVo~Fx3JO-vjGMU3ulbxxdftqc-Jap1LVqI3iwVAUfyr9kQa2FdVI0di8DtxajDZKO4ANDiKDQcKhA0dL3PYchzhHpmGsNkz7QZAC4Ow699dHcey906XYRjH04pUTNhNAU5t9r1ngwXybIoo4Ne63C6DcwBePazAnfFJf1uFCPrL~W3acmIL9wBfmGp9RmjIaJjwr1QD096ZBF8z5w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/3484462c7de2423c9ce957720c801235_b04-la-cartera-roja.mp3?Expires=1794099469&Signature=W8TNGmzt1WWF3nOUFhoFblNU608DAZAxziR5nsCNLA39PnfELIu8R1qGjbZvG9jynVvA8vl1nzuav1~qK8LPQkNUf7JNkTt8K9MfvEx5H2scdcvVIP0Y8kiIj2OjnnkCTEJLNOXK5ikaFNcM~~uAb1eiqtkAUGRUkjGiaxJDJfn9uSsRs-X7C9zcPTtrQ2faPct0c~NjEEi495DzqBpdlYYqpFm5SsdxzKonqJDeBYv1tbqfvJ6d5umWsJd4jHiMk2TeDuKFW7bRVr0pku-ngsQtrRJxM51plJPPI6BYVbX6tZf9sn1cppW3GrrD1hyp5EN24fI2p-wHXk9oMmGZkA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
