    {
      "id": "5d3839a6-f43a-4dcf-9124-00f4845818a7",
      "title": "Leia a comparação curta e observe a mudança final da cor.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "8efbe257-bb1f-4135-8299-a83b2d7bbd0d",
          "textContent": "<p>Algumas cores mudam para combinar com o objeto.</p><ul><li><strong>negro -> negra</strong></li><li><strong>rojo -> roja</strong></li></ul><p>Com <strong>la cartera</strong>, usamos a forma feminina: <strong>la cartera roja</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c72c969e-979d-48cd-aac1-4e9449791c70",
      "title": "Olhe a imagem, escute o áudio e observe a combinação em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "493f50bc-cfed-48bf-8c3a-b1855a8a7c4d",
          "textContent": "<p>Olhe, escute e leia.</p><p><strong>las gafas blancas</strong></p><p>Em português: os óculos brancos.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/f93caaf7f18340e38a87f8ad5ba7c3b3_b06-las-gafas-blancas.png?Expires=1794099469&Signature=dE6mEcl9V57I8nfzNndk5aseDjvayBojEhFRXgt1mli9K-XkHjt0DkSjMywyLEI3ioKg~Xx2AU6sQhJU~MrStGWOUEhDDMB5vikYsr2WfCoybNipjtI88CQfkKr~dU8VV4YoE3Ai5ZOtFLcRLcz03dYPN4JPA-ObHASkj7f8irvlYL5WVWWmXqGywFBHi9kn2FnLFihEguWOe1l~NJGqFPcCDGmgup4umakkZgjHY5aAQDzDQMkUSp37Ur7HtVZXxDWU~c-EX1i-CRX0K0SgV0SE0DR9MWmccuTfrOGnlsq7qFJMrdUWhDA0coEVopEiRg8CmxtWRkZWbgwg8d8yBQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
